        "subject": "LU-20211 idl: reserve OBD_CONNECT2_LAYOUT_REPLACE flag",
        "message": "LU-20211 idl: reserve OBD_CONNECT2_LAYOUT_REPLACE flag\n\nReserve OBD_CONNECT2_LAYOUT_REPLACE at 0x8000000000000ULL for an MDS\nthat replaces the layout of a file on trunc(0) when some stripes are\ninactive.  Only the flag, obd_connect_names[] and the wire checks are\nadded here so the value can land before the feature patch.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I789edf2abd22e8308c335901bb523a4f60ae884c\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
